ついては以下ポストをご参照ください。\n　https://x.com/tenpa_illust/status/2007701892202459539?s=20\n・身長：162㎝\n・モチーフに少し鳥っぽさを入れています。\n\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kusonkodokodoko/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca919ddd/uploads/origins/372a8931-4076-44d3-8ab6-0c28ebf35296?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=559618c31c161c31561ab411cafe3ce9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca919ddd/uploads/origins/372a8931-4076-44d3-8ab6-0c28ebf35296?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=559618c31c161c31561ab411cafe3ce9, https://si.imgix.net/ca919ddd/uploads/origins/372a8931-4076-44d3-8ab6-0c28ebf35296?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4353482c3cfb2db9d7bf1eb640336d7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca919ddd/uploads/origins/372a8931-4076-44d3-8ab6-0c28ebf35296?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd02affd4d7242551bbbee3941665a30 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "オリキャラのくらちゃんを描いて頂きたいです！構図等は全ておまかせします！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kusonkodokodoko/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32b46e75/uploads/origins/45b0b022-3b51-47e6-8899-4393e935bda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cf5286f5306e47c912401f49b4f3daf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/32b46e75/uploads/origins/45b0b022-3b51-47e6-8899-4393e935bda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cf5286f5306e47c912401f49b4f3daf, https://si.imgix.net/32b46e75/uploads/origins/45b0b022-3b51-47e6-8899-4393e935bda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86ef883762391171ce43cdee96138e23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/32b46e75/uploads/origins/45b0b022-3b51-47e6-8899-4393e935bda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdedd80ac41d00fcd9a782ec50c33141 